<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>L’Élixir | Skincare, Makeup, Hair Care & Fragrance</title>
<meta name="description" content="L’Élixir: skincare, makeup, hair care, and fragrance in one place. Shop premium beauty essentials for every skin tone and style.">
<style>
:root{--bg:#f6ece9;--ink:#2a1620;--plum:#5b2244;--rose:#c9798f;--line:#e2cdc8;--card:#fbf5f3}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#1d1017;--ink:#f3e4e1;--plum:#e8a9bd;--rose:#d98ba3;--line:#3d2631;--card:#27151e}}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:18px/1.7 Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif}
header,main,footer{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:28px}
.logo{font-size:1.6rem;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--plum)}
nav a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;margin-left:22px;font:15px system-ui,sans-serif}
nav a:hover,nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--rose);outline:none;text-decoration:underline}
.hero{padding:90px 0 70px}
h1{font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,7vw,4.8rem);line-height:1.08;color:var(--plum);max-width:14em}
.hero p{margin-top:28px;max-width:34em}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:34px;padding:14px 30px;background:var(--plum);color:var(--bg);text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;font:600 15px system-ui,sans-serif}
.btn:focus-visible,.btn:hover{background:var(--rose);color:#fff}
.range{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:18px;padding:30px 0 80px}
.range div{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:26px}
.range h2{font-weight:400;font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--plum)}
.range p{font-size:.95rem;margin-top:6px}
footer{padding-top:30px;padding-bottom:40px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font:14px system-ui,sans-serif}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo">L’Élixir</div>
  <nav><a href="#range">Skincare</a><a href="#range">Makeup</a><a href="#range">Hair</a><a href="#range">Fragrance</a></nav>
</header>
<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Discover the elixir to your most radiant self.</h1>
    <p>Welcome to L’Élixir, your destination for complete beauty. From radiant skincare and flawless makeup to nourishing hair care and captivating fragrances, we bring everything you need to look and feel your best into one place. Every product is chosen for quality, performance, and care, and formulated to celebrate all skin tones, textures, and styles. Whether you’re building a daily ritual or finding your next signature scent, L’Élixir helps you turn self-care into an art.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#range">Shop all products</a>
  </section>
  <section class="range" id="range">
    <div><h2>Skincare</h2><p>Daily rituals for a radiant glow.</p></div>
    <div><h2>Makeup</h2><p>Flawless looks for every skin tone.</p></div>
    <div><h2>Hair care</h2><p>Nourishment for every texture.</p></div>
    <div><h2>Fragrance</h2><p>Find your signature scent.</p></div>
  </section>
</main>
<footer>© L’Élixir. The art of beauty, bottled.</footer>
</body>
</html>
